# look net, experiment of 2026-11-22. same size in and out, residual on the input luma, place after dither removal (default).
# trained on real before/after video pairs of one game ("dlss 5" off -> on, youtube 2160p averaged to 1080p scale, sources: jp vd), input luma -> the enhanced luma.
# target: only the local part of the change (per-pair tone curve and everything coarser than ~8 px removed). input: video luma, 8 bit, dither removal.
# loss l1 + gradient l1. 6 convs 3x3, 16 features, relu, 9585 weights, 7036 steps, ema weights.
meyra-net 1
name GTA6 look 6x16 detail
